WEBVTT

00:00:03.812 --> 00:00:07.792
I thought you are all realised souls already.

00:00:22.163 --> 00:00:26.454
But how did you get them here,
I don't know.

00:00:27.937 --> 00:00:31.203
Are they afraid of
the Albert Hall or what?

00:00:32.755 --> 00:00:33.863
All right.

00:00:33.943 --> 00:00:36.766
So I think we can try that again.

00:00:36.846 --> 00:00:40.025
Just put your hands towards me like that.

00:00:41.844 --> 00:00:43.442
Just take out my shoes.

00:00:45.354 --> 00:00:46.500
It's all right.

00:00:46.923 --> 00:00:50.788
You have to take out your shoes, that's all.

00:00:52.808 --> 00:00:55.863
Now as I said yesterday

00:00:56.984 --> 00:01:02.592
that another simple thing is that you have to forgive yourself.

00:01:02.672 --> 00:01:06.462
As it is, you know it's a fashion to
feel guilty for everything.

00:01:06.542 --> 00:01:10.766
I don't know how it has started,
but to feel guilty.

00:01:10.846 --> 00:01:16.672
It's a fashion — say "sorry".
Formerly, on the telephone

00:01:16.752 --> 00:01:19.445
we used to say, "I beg your pardon,"
all right?

00:01:19.525 --> 00:01:22.657
Nowadays they say sorry. Sorry for what?

00:01:23.326 --> 00:01:25.915
So this sorryness is too much.

00:01:25.995 --> 00:01:29.318
Now don't be sorry for anything here.

00:01:29.398 --> 00:01:32.855
You shouldn't feel sorry in any way.

00:01:32.935 --> 00:01:34.290
Don't feel guilty.

00:01:34.370 --> 00:01:36.292
You have done nothing wrong.

00:01:36.372 --> 00:01:37.827
Believe me.

00:01:37.907 --> 00:01:42.853
It's all nonsense that you must have read some novel

00:01:42.933 --> 00:01:45.859
or might have read some, I don't know what,

00:01:45.939 --> 00:01:47.837
that you have to feel guilty.

00:01:47.917 --> 00:01:51.707
You are not sinners by any chance,
take it from me.

00:01:51.787 --> 00:01:55.760
You are not sinners. It's all just
money-making propositions, I think.

00:01:55.840 --> 00:01:58.312
To say you are all sinners, you give us money,

00:01:58.392 --> 00:02:01.187
so all your sins will be washed off.

00:02:04.333 --> 00:02:08.200
I don't know, they also give guarantee
card I understand.

00:02:12.475 --> 00:02:16.165
So all these gimmicks
you must understand.

00:02:16.245 --> 00:02:19.969
It has nothing to do with reality.

00:02:20.049 --> 00:02:24.335
So just in your heart,

00:02:24.415 --> 00:02:27.543
you believe me that you are not sinners.

00:02:27.623 --> 00:02:30.865
Not to feel guilty for small, small things.

00:02:30.945 --> 00:02:36.452
Our norms are so much that you can
feel guilty for anything.

00:02:36.532 --> 00:02:39.655
Say you spilled coffee. Finished.

00:02:39.735 --> 00:02:43.292
All your life you are bothered
that I spilled coffee.

00:02:43.372 --> 00:02:46.584
I mean coffee is to be spilled only.

00:02:48.010 --> 00:02:49.966
I don't understand.

00:02:50.046 --> 00:02:56.483
So these stupid nonsensical norms that we
have adopted

00:02:56.563 --> 00:03:01.877
are really responsible for creating this feeling of guilt within us also.

00:03:01.957 --> 00:03:06.463
Also all funny ideas you read, the books you read and things you read

00:03:06.543 --> 00:03:09.852
because you are on the way of righteousness.

00:03:09.932 --> 00:03:12.433
You are on the way of reality.

00:03:12.513 --> 00:03:15.610
So you start saying,
"Oh my God, I did this.

00:03:15.690 --> 00:03:18.894
I should not have done it."
It's all right. Forget it.

00:03:18.974 --> 00:03:23.344
If you have done anything wrong at that moment only, you should neutralize it.

00:03:23.424 --> 00:03:27.236
But don't carry the load all your
life on your left Vishuddhi.

00:03:27.316 --> 00:03:32.478
It's a very dangerous thing
because you develop spondylitis.

00:03:33.207 --> 00:03:36.698
If not that, you can develop angina.

00:03:36.778 --> 00:03:43.730
So this is a very important centre and
don't feel guilty for no fault of yours.

00:03:44.700 --> 00:03:48.663
So this is another very simple condition.

00:03:48.743 --> 00:03:55.213
And the third one is, as you forgive yourself for everything,

00:03:55.293 --> 00:03:58.067
you should forgive others also.

00:03:58.147 --> 00:04:03.239
Because yesterday I told you, whether you
forgive or don't forgive, you don't do anything.

00:04:03.319 --> 00:04:07.932
But if you don't forgive others, then
you are playing into wrong hands.

00:04:08.012 --> 00:04:12.149
So, just say, "I forgive everyone,"

00:04:12.229 --> 00:04:16.264
which is very important because
here people believe that,

00:04:16.344 --> 00:04:19.321
"How can I forgive?"
is very difficult.

00:04:19.401 --> 00:04:21.690
What is difficult? Nothing.

00:04:21.770 --> 00:04:25.027
Just have to say, "Mother, I
forgive everyone." Finished.

00:04:25.107 --> 00:04:30.833
Once for all you say that and you'll be
surprised, this centre will open out.

00:04:30.913 --> 00:04:36.172
Without these two centres opening up,
the Kundalini cannot pierce through.

00:04:36.252 --> 00:04:41.410
So just help yourself with these two things.
Just in your heart you have to say.

00:04:41.490 --> 00:04:46.382
Now in your hands just see.
Watch what's happening on your hands.

00:04:46.462 --> 00:04:49.685
As I told you yesterday,
all these fingers

00:04:49.765 --> 00:04:57.493
are activated when you get your realisation or vibrations.

00:04:57.573 --> 00:05:03.429
Because these are all centres of the
sympathetic nervous system endings.

00:05:03.509 --> 00:05:11.923
And in these centres what you find is that
these are centres on the right hand side

00:05:12.003 --> 00:05:16.011
are for your physical and mental being.

00:05:16.091 --> 00:05:18.848
Left hand side are for
your emotional being.

00:05:18.928 --> 00:05:22.858
So you can see these five centres,
six and seven.

00:05:22.938 --> 00:05:27.523
This is the seventh centre which is here
in the head in the limbic area.

00:05:27.603 --> 00:05:30.023
So you have these seven centres

00:05:30.103 --> 00:05:36.607
and you start feeling on these seven centres the vibrations, the divine power.

00:05:36.687 --> 00:05:38.868
See that.

00:05:38.948 --> 00:05:46.793
Now one scientist in Russia I told you yesterday has
found out through his calculations and mathematical things

00:05:46.873 --> 00:05:52.018
from my photograph that according to him I am the source of this cosmic energy.

00:05:52.098 --> 00:05:58.956
I don't know what to say but whatever it is you just feel it yourself on your fingertips.

00:05:59.036 --> 00:06:00.429
Just feel it.

00:06:01.711 --> 00:06:06.990
A cool breeze or a hot breeze
will be coming here.